{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "422521cd-8ea5-8a8a-925e-cd34262baacf",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T14:53:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Susan Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:51:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:51:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Yeah, I'd like to report a dip in the road. Well, it's more of a hole by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:51:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:51:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "277 Ocean Avenue. Right out front of the house, on the street side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:51:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "277 Ocean Avenue. And tell me what it looks like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:51:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the utility crew dug a trench there last fall, patched it, and it's settled since then. Now there's a dip about the width of a car. Not a disaster. Just a very good way to lose a hubcap."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:52:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A trench that settled, got it. How deep would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hard to say, because it's full of water right now. That's the problem. It looks like a puddle, so you can't tell how deep it is until you're in it. I've watched two people find out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:52:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. So it fills up with water and you can't see the bottom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:52:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Dry day, you'd see it. After any rain, it's camouflaged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:52:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a request to have it looked at. Do you want the street added to the repair list?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:52:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. That's what I'm asking. Add it to the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:52:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I have 277 Ocean Avenue, settled utility trench, water-filled dip in the road. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:52:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Oh, and if somebody comes out, they'll hear me before they see me. The neighbor two doors down has a wind chime collection. Like, a lot of them. You can follow the noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:52:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I'll make a note so they know where to look. Can I get a callback number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:53:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:53:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0172. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:53:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Susan Gifford."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:53:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Gifford. It's in the system and a crew will assess it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T14:53:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks."
    }
  ],
